<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.80 vs   0.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.46 vs   1.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.56 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Sales		   12.85 vs   9.52</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.62 vs   8.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	16.02 vs  11.39</p>
<p> Operating profit    17.45 vs  11.63</p>
<p> Sales		  116.56 vs  77.00</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionery is</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Cukiernicze Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
